flowchart TB
  S1["<b>1 · USER INPUT</b><br/>Customer Database (Asana) ·<br/>analyst form entries · Advisor questions"]
  S2["<b>2 · DATA COLLECTION</b><br/>OFAC SDN · UN · EU FSF · UK OFSI · UAE EOCN · Canada SEMA<br/>Google News (5 locales) · GDELT · OpenSanctions · Wikidata"]
  S3["<b>3 · PREPROCESSING</b><br/>Unicode fold &amp; normalise · transliteration variants (AR/TR)<br/>sanitise untrusted web text · prompt-injection screen"]
  S4["<b>4 · AI PROCESSING</b><br/>Fuzzy match + name-core check · 50% ownership rule<br/>severity/relevance triage · related-party graph<br/><i>optional LLM sharpen (never downgrade)</i>"]
  S5["<b>5 · DECISION SUPPORT</b><br/>Explainable risk rating (factors shown)<br/>'why flagged / what to check' notes · delta vs last run"]
  S6["<b>6 · COMPLIANCE RECOMMENDATION</b><br/>EDD cadence · next checks · goAML STR/SAR draft<br/><i>proposals only — nothing is decided</i>"]
  S7{{"<b>7 · HUMAN REVIEW</b><br/>MLRO case subtasks · disposition per hit<br/>four-eyes review · analyst override (ratchet-up only)"}}
  S8["<b>8 · AUDIT TRAIL</b><br/>Agent action log · QA governance gate · audit lines<br/>hash-chained device log · 10-year retention"]
  S9["<b>9 · CONTINUOUS ADAPTATION</b><br/>Delta state between runs · learned delivery budget<br/>weekly evals · monthly watchdogs · <i>no model retraining</i>"]

  S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S5 --> S6 --> S7 --> S8 --> S9
  S9 -. "state feeds next run" .-> S2

